#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""vimunit: tools for the vim-unit keystroke compatibility test suite.

Subcommands:
  run      Run the tests in Vim and/or Neovim, the reference implementations.
  fill     Run the tests in a reference editor and write its results into the
           test files wherever an expected state is missing (or, with
           --update, wrong).
  export   Export the parsed suite as JSON, for integrations with other editors.
  report   Score a results file produced by an integration.
  lint     Check test files for problems.
  fmt      Normalize the formatting of test files.
  options  Print the supported options and their baseline values.

Run `./vimunit <subcommand> --help` for details. Requires Python 3.8+ and no
third-party packages. See doc/format.md for the test file format.
"""

